From 3ef803021758935ec52227f99a51bda87b2824ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: guirguispierre <guirguispierre@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 13:38:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add /issue context command + pokedex_add_context MCP
 tool

Allow users to add follow-up context to open issues without filing a new one.
Works across all 3 surfaces: Discord (/issue context), stdio MCP, and
Cloudflare Workers MCP. Context appends to threadContext, updates triage
embeds, and posts to issue threads. Closed issues block additions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
